# r2-fe-b4.abi in the engine's upright frame (Cell::upright: a1 on +x, a2 in the xy plane), xred unchanged.
# Symmetry on (ABINIT finds the group; RUN.txt step 5 omits nsym 1): symrhoij and symdij act; kptopt 3 keeps the
# full k mesh, so every engine k-point has its ABINIT row.
# r2-fe.abi with 4 more bands than its 14 (nbdbuf 4: tolwfr holds on the first 14, the ones compared).
acell 3*1.0 Angstrom
rprim 2.450851892709962 0.000000000000000 0.000000000000000  -0.816950630903320 2.310685324025465 0.000000000000000  -0.816950630903320 -1.155342662012733 2.001112190757930
natom 1
ntypat 1
znucl 26
typat 1
xred 0.0 0.0 0.0
pseudos "Fe/Fe.GGA_PBE-JTH.xml"
ecut 12.0
pawecutdg 24.0
ngkpt 4 4 4
nshiftk 1
shiftk 0 0 0
occopt 3
nband 18
nbdbuf 4
tsmear 0.01
nsppol 2
spinat 0 0 2.5
istwfk 64*1
iscf 17
ixc -497498
usekden 1
pawxcdev 0
